{
    "background_story": "Andy was a brilliant clockmaker who spent most of his life studying the intricate wheelwork of timepieces. Growing up in a small village, he was fascinated by the way gears and springs worked together to keep perfect time. As an apprentice, Andy honed his skills under the guidance of a master clockmaker, learning the art of precision and patience. Years later, he opened his own shop, where he crafted exquisite clocks and watches that were sought after by collectors and connoisseurs. Andy's masterpiece, a grand astronomical clock, was his magnum opus, featuring a complex wheelwork mechanism that tracked the movements of celestial bodies. His work was a testament to the beauty of intricate mechanics and the human desire to measure and understand time.",
